  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">LWAVE</a>&#160;= [logical]<br /> Default: <b>LWAVE</b> = .TRUE.&#160;\n</p><p>Description: Determines whether the wavefunctions are written at the end of a run.\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p>The wavefunctions are written to the <a href=\"/wiki/WAVECAR\" title=\"WAVECAR\">WAVECAR</a> file by default. If <code class=\"vasp-dark-link-panel\" style=\"padding: 2px\"><a href=\"/wiki/LH5\" title=\"LH5\">LH5</a> = T</code>, the wavefunctions are written to the <a href=\"/wiki/Vaspwave.h5\" title=\"Vaspwave.h5\">vaspwave.h5</a> instead.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Related_tags_and_articles\">Related tags and articles</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=LWAVE&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Related tags and articles\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=LWAVE&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section&#39;s source code: Related tags and articles\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Restart_and_output_files_cheat_sheet\" title=\"Restart and output files cheat sheet\">Restart and output files cheat sheet</a>\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/WAVECAR\" title=\"WAVECAR\">WAVECAR</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/LH5\" title=\"LH5\">LH5</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Vaspwave.h5\" title=\"Vaspwave.h5\">vaspwave.h5</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/LCHARG\" title=\"LCHARG\">LCHARG</a>\n</p><p><br />\n<a href=\"/wiki/Special:Search/%22LWAVE%22_incategory:%22HowTo%22\" title=\"Special:Search/&quot;LWAVE&quot; incategory:&quot;HowTo&quot;\">Workflows that use this tag</a>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260717124230\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.011 second